<section class="page-hero section-dark"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><%= page.data.eyebrow %></p><h1><%= page.data.heading %></h1></div><p class="hero-lead"><%= page.data.lead %></p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Proposed themes</p><h2>Ideas designed for useful discussion.</h2></div><ol class="speaking-list"><% page.data.topics.forEach((topic,i)=>{ %><li><span>0<%= i+1 %></span><div><h2><%= topic[0] %></h2><p><%= topic[1] %></p></div></li><% }) %></ol></div></section><section class="section section-teal"><div class="container speaking-formats"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Format options</p><h2>Shape the conversation to the room.</h2><div class="tag-cloud tag-cloud-dark"><% page.data.formats.forEach((item)=>{ %><span><%= item %></span><% }) %></div></div><div><h3>What to include in an invitation</h3><p>Share the event purpose, audience, preferred date, format, venue or online platform, session duration and expected contribution.</p><a class="button button-light" href="<%= urlFor('/contact/') %>?topic=speaking">Discuss an invitation</a></div></div></section>


